# GRUB SHIFT: a sparkmite's sparks fly two tiles each way at its own height:
# a planter in the way stops them, and grubs (or Tilly) on lower ground are
# safe from them.
game grubshift
wait 5
cheat contract 1 7
cheat clear
cheat tilly 3 0
cheat elev 3 2 1
cheat elev 2 2 1
cheat bug 3 2 1 1
cheat bug 2 2 3 0
cheat bug 3 3 3 0
cheat bug 5 2 5 0
cheat use 6 3 2
expect kills == 2
expect bug_at33 == 3
expect bug_at52 == 5
expect status == 0
cheat clear
cheat tilly 4 4
cheat bug 2 2 1 1
cheat elev 3 2 1
cheat bug 4 2 3 0
cheat bug 1 2 3 0
cheat chip 5 17
cheat use 5 2 2
expect kills == 4
expect bug_at42 == 3
expect bug_at12 == 0
